## Repository Structure

- `portfolio/` is a **git submodule** with its own remote (`https://github.com/jefebrydon/portfolio`)
- Commit/push changes from within `portfolio/`, not the parent repo

## Tech Stack

- **Origin**: Webflow export — preserve Webflow class naming conventions
- **Pages**: `index.html` + case study pages (`peek-pro-booking-flow.html`, `eagle-pay.html`, etc.)
- **Design system page**: `ui.html` documents colors, typography, and components
- **React components**: `components/` folder (TSX) — used for JeffBot UI only

## Key File Locations

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| CSS variables & main styles | `css/jeff-brydon.webflow.css` |
| JeffBot frontend | `js/jeffbot.js` |
| JeffBot API (serverless) | `api/chat.js` |
| React components | `components/*.tsx` |

## Design System — Colors

Use CSS variables from `:root` in `css/jeff-brydon.webflow.css`:

- **Primary**: `--teal-primary` (#229DB1), `--teal-dark` (#307489), `--teal-light` (#49C8D7)
- **Hover background**: `--teal-hover-bg` (#dffcff)
- **Greys**: `--grey-50` through `--grey-300`
- **Gradients**: `--primary-gradient-start/end`, `--primary-gradient-hover-start/end`

When modifying colors, update both the CSS and the `ui.html` documentation.

## Conventions

- Keep inline scripts colocated in HTML files (Webflow pattern)
- New videos need poster frames (`*-poster-00001.jpg`)
- Secrets (`OPENAI_API_KEY`, `VECTOR_STORE_ID`) are in Vercel env vars — never expose to browser
- Local dev: `npm run dev` (runs live-server on port 8080)

## JeffBot Architecture

- Frontend: vanilla JS in `js/jeffbot.js`
- Backend: Vercel serverless function at `/api/chat`
- Uses OpenAI Responses API with `file_search` (RAG)
- Config auto-detects localhost vs production in `js/jeffbot-config.js`
